  "cnt.guide.surveillance.s3.e2": "“QR codes and rules” tab: display or print the QR codes of the rooms and of the entrance to install in the school.",
  "cnt.guide.enseignant.label": "Teacher",
  "cnt.guide.enseignant.intro": "A teacher signs in with the same screen as the rest of the staff. They only see their own classes and subjects.",
  "cnt.guide.enseignant.s1.t": "Check-in",
  "cnt.guide.enseignant.s1.e1": "“My check-in”: scan the QR code of the room (or of the entrance, depending on the school) on arriving and on leaving.",
  "cnt.guide.enseignant.s1.e2": "Opening a QR code directly with the phone's camera checks in automatically, even right after signing in.",
  "cnt.guide.enseignant.s2.t": "Class and teaching",
  "cnt.guide.enseignant.s2.e1": "“Attendance and absences”: take the register for their own sessions, if the school entrusts it to them.",
  "cnt.guide.enseignant.s2.e2": "“Lessons and homework log”: note the lesson content and the work to do, immediately visible to parents.",
  "cnt.guide.enseignant.s2.e3": "“Grades and report cards”: enter the grades of their assessments as long as the term is not validated by Management.",
  "cnt.guide.enseignant.s2.e4": "“Discipline”: report an incident or a commendation for a student in one of their classes.",
  "cnt.guide.parent.label": "Parent",
  "cnt.guide.parent.intro": "A parent has their own area, separate from the staff's, reached from “Parents' area”.",
  "cnt.guide.parent.s1.t": "Activation and sign-in",
  "cnt.guide.parent.s1.e1": "With the code given by the school office, open “Parents' area” then “Activate my account”: phone number, code, password to choose.",
  "cnt.guide.parent.s1.e2": "Then sign in with this same number and password.",
  "cnt.guide.parent.s2.t": "Following your children",
  "cnt.guide.parent.s2.e1": "Each child's page brings together the timetable, absences, published grades and report cards, homework log, discipline and documents.",
  "cnt.guide.parent.s2.e2": "“Fees”: balance by instalment, payment history, and online payment by Mobile Money when the school has enabled it.",
  "cnt.guide.parent.s2.e3": "“Documents”: request a school enrolment certificate directly from the parents' area.",
  "cnt.guide.parent.s3.t": "Messages and notifications",
  "cnt.guide.parent.s3.e1": "“Messages”: write to a teacher of your child's class, or to the school office.",
  "cnt.guide.parent.s3.e2": "“Notifications”: turn on alerts on your phone to be told of an absence, a timetable change or a new message.",
